WEBVTT

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.230
Hanna-chan...

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.820
<b>Ikebukuro Post Office</b>

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.160
<b>Pedestrians and 
Bicyclists Only</b>

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.250
I see.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.880
I'm sorry.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.580
It was so nice of you to come.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.590
Not at all.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.050
It doesn't seem like she's sick, but...

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.010
She won't tell me what happened.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.440
Lately, she'd actually been excited about 
that card game, which was rare.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.490
Um, Hanna-chan is...

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.070
I'm sure she's...

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.010
Devouring Prey / Tragedy and Comedy

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:46.000
There is no exit in the Selector battles.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.810
Only an unending chain of hatred and pain.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:52.650
I'm done.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.680
Morikawa.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.400
Shirai-kun.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.250
You're not working today, huh?

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.790
It's none of your business, is it?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.590
This will be the last time.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.160
If it really bothers you, I won't ask again.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.750
So could you come with me for a bit?

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:15.640
Please?

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.100
Hanna-chan, it's Suzuko.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.270
Can we talk for a little while?

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.540
Um, hey... I made a cake today.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.900
I was hoping you'd try some.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:43.870
You like chocolate-banana, right?

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:46.640
Um... Oh, I know!

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.180
I'll hang the bag on the door.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.170
<b>Hanna-chan, 

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.780
I'm sure it was around here...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.010
There it is.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.500
Oh, good.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.120
I remembered it.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.450
Hurry and come with me, Morikawa.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:20.000
They didn't see us.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.220
Come on, follow them!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.600
I-I'm sorry...

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:29.790
We need to make sure Satomi-oniichan 
has lots of fun, don't we?

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.460
Wow, this hasn't changed at all.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.780
It's kind of strange.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.250
It wasn't that long ago,

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.300
but it feels like it's been ages.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.440
Do you remember this?

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:48.740
Iida, our teacher, said that 
if we won on field day,

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.350
he'd buy us all drinks.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.810
I was on the sprint team.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:56.010
I was so excited, I went barefoot, but...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:58.900
And then...

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.100
Um...

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.530
In the end, you tripped.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.860
Did I?

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.450
I forgot.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.380
I know!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:09.050
Let's go see the classroom, too.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.320
Thanks.

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.450
Thanks to you, I was able to remember a lot.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.060
I...

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.300
Hey, Morikawa.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:26.570
What do you really think about 
being chosen as a Selector?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.940
I'm going home.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:34.270
I'm planning to start playing soccer again.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:38.730
I wanted to tell you here.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.820
What kind of tear-jerker is this?

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:49.360
I don't like kids who spoil things.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.700
<b>Here's the video, Onii-chan!</b>

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.870
<b>Calling 

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.570
Hi there! It's Satomi!

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.480
What's wrong, Rio-chan?

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.100
I lost the battle.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:02.280
I only have one coin left!

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.770
Oh, dear...

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:05.260
That's terrible.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.820
What do I do?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:09.430
What am I supposed to do?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.890
Just leave it to me.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.650
Hey, video star!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.730
That was quite the show back there.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.650
You... That's...

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.400
Hey, let me act with you next time.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.120
I'd do well against Chinatsu-chan.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:32.740
Is that what you wanted?

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:36.970
No. Let's have a battle right now.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.140
A battle?

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:40.120
You're a Selector?!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.210
Yeah.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.050
If you win, you can be rid of me,

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:46.200
the guy who won't leave Chinatsu-chan alone.

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.710
Nice offer, right?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.470
Let's have fun, boy.

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:51.890
Shou-chan...

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:58.470
Don't you want to make Chinatsu-chan yours?

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.610
I'm not doing the wrong thing, am I?

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:08.890
Nope.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.950
You're always right, Chi-chan.

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:14.050
And you always will be.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:19.580
Attack.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:23.750
Donor!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.300
What's this?

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.540
You accepted my offer, 
but you don't seem too into it.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:34.550
Oh, are you nervous?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:39.310
Want your big brother to teach you 
everything you need to know?

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.610
Call Wonder!

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:42.190
Snow Queen effect!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.520
Carnival.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:48.560
Is that all you've got?

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:50.240
Wimp.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.680
Hey, hear what she said, cutie boy?

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.980
You can't be the only one having a good time.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:01.020
You need to find exactly 
where your partner likes it,

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:02.960
and slowly, slowly tease them there...

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.880
That's why she dumped you, isn't it?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.160
Why are you so obsessed with Morikawa?

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.640
What are you after?!

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.740
Is that what you want to know?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:18.400
Are you that interested in us?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:19.500
Well?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.690
Tell me!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.690
Maybe because it's fun?

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:28.150
Making a girl into the way you like her,

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.200
controlling her, deceiving her, destroying her...

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.530
Of course it's fun!

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.640
You really feel the same way, don't you?

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:42.960
You grabbed her even though she didn't 
want it, told her she was wrong,

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:45.060
insisted you were right,

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.170
slowly put her under more stress...

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.880
You felt fulfilled doing that, didn't you?

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.900
Am I wrong?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.630
I have to erase you.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.720
I have to erase you, no matter what!

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.800
Arc Destruct!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.920
Idol Defense.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:12.690
That's why Chinatsu-chan chose me,

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.550
virgin.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:24.910
Shou-chan...

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:30.400
Chinatsu-chan didn't want some kid 
who played with his memories.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.630
She wanted the strength to go forward.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:39.620
I'll give you a place where 
even you can be useful.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.700
I'll stop this.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.480
Hanna-chan...

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.050
<i>I couldn't do anything.</i>

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:21.250
<i>I decided that I'd support Hanna-chan,</i>

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.260
<i>but I couldn't say anything to her.</i>

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.000
Hey, you.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.890
You're a Selector, right?

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.140
Battle me.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.570
All right.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.950
<b>Hanna-chan, 

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.040
<i>I want to be stronger.</i>

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.290
Suzuko-san...

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.950
<i>So that I can protect what I care about.</i>

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.350
<i>That's why I'll fight.</i>

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:53.720
<i>So...</i>

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:57.050
Riru, grow.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.490
<i>I'll become strong!</i>

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:11.940
Unworthy.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.650
I left Yuuto to die.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.870
I don't have the right to feel this way—

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:20.400
Hanna, you...

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.860
Hanna...

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:25.980
I'm sorry!

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.200
Wait, Hanna!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.350
Was what you just said...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.330
Hanna!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:45.690
Yuuto, I'm sorry...

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:48.430
I'm sorry... I...

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:50.180
No!

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.420
That was an accident.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.880
I... I...

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:04.760
Suzuko-chan said that you'd been fighting 
on your own for a long time.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:08.990
That you were fighting to take back 
something important to you.

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:13.960
That was Yuuto, wasn't it?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:18.880
You were working so hard all by 
yourself for Yuuto's sake, right?

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.010
I'm sorry.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:25.840
I didn't realize.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.400
I'm sorry.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.390
<b>Shirai-kun</b>

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.230
Morikawa?

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.640
I thought that was the last time.

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:42.370
I forgot to say something.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:45.160
Just don't forget your real wish.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.700
And I really...

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.010
I really do like...

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:50.820
Never mind.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.000
See you!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.120
<b>Satomi Kou</b>

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.280
Hello?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.100
Shou-chan.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:14.270
What do you want?

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.010
I wanted to show you how it feels

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:20.860
to look down on a piece of scum.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:26.620
You want to be stronger than 
anyone in the world, after all.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:29.500
I just want to be rid of my memories of Suzuko.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.700
You're still saying that?

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:36.130
You can't go back now.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:40.510
A battle is about to begin.

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:43.000
Both players have one coin left.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:43.690
What do you—

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:46.960
Since just waiting for it 
to end is a waste of time,

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.290
why don't we make a bet?

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.100
Who will you bet on?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.530
Rio-chan or Shirai-kun? Who will disappear?

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.730
You mean that battle is...

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.830
Oh, no... Don't tell me you've forgotten.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:03.320
You were the one who involved 
them in this, Chinatsu-chan!

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:15.040
I love that face! It's the best!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.200
Kou.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.740
Looks like you have a visitor.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.730
I've been waiting

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:26.900
for the little bitch who's been 
trying to sniff me out.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.740
<i>Shirai-kun...</i>

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:37.680
Ability Mind!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.620
Mommy!

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:44.820
What do I do?

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.500
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:49.610
Calculate... Place a route...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.610
Rio-chan!

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.750
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.580
How can I win?

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.200
Mommy!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.610
No! No! I want my mommy!

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:00.610
It's no good. I can't do it.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:01.500
Shou-chan...

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.460
I just can't do it.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:10.510
Okay, let's get started!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.660
You first.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:17.310
I've really been looking forward 
to doing it with you—

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.310
Grow.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.490
Place SIGNI.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:20.580
Turn end.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.440
You're so cold...

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:28.190
But that really turns me on!

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.700
Carnival, grow.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.340
Summon Antares,

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.160
and use Flame-Awned Flash.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:41.620
Grow.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.000
Discard hand and attack!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.470
This is amazing!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.650
Tell me more about you!

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:57.600
Turn end.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.930
Come to think of it,

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:03.900
I heard you were an LRIG 
in the last Selector battle.

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:08.950
I'm actually grateful to you guys.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:11.060
You stole those girls' wishes,

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.790
trampled their feelings,

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:14.950
and created me.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:21.030
Thank you, Mizushima Kiyoi-chan!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:22.510
I'll stop you...

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.040
I'm going to stop you!

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:25.670
Sakurae!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.880
Stop me?

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.670
I don't think that's possible.

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:35.180
Has anyone who's learned the truth 
ever been able to stop the battles?

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.050
Then what are you doing right now?

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:39.300
Playing house?

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.590
Play-acting?

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:41.780
Playing a game!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.480
You...

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.680
You're nothing but evil.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.890
If I can end you, that's enough.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.440
Bravo!

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:51.400
You really are just like me.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.940
I'm happy!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:56.020
You understand me!

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:56.810
What are you sayi—

00:16:56.810 --> 00:17:03.090
You wanted to see those girls' faces as 
they suffered and despaired, right?

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:03.890
No, I—

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:05.180
Oh, sorry!

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:07.200
Yeah, I was wrong!

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:10.360
You tried to save your friend.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.520
But you were betrayed and fell into despair.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:15.050
And that's why

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:19.070
you have a reason to inflict the 
same thing on other people.

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:19.670
What are you—

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:23.450
I guess you can't help it, after that 
horrible thing you went through.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.690
Come on, relax a bit.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.800
I can understand you.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.310
And then we can really go at it.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:37.940
It's true that I trampled on the girls' feelings.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.870
I knew that the ending wouldn't 
be what was promised.

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:46.710
A part of me told myself that I was a victim, too.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.670
So I didn't try to think of anything more.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:54.160
But I'm done with that!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.010
So, are you done with your repentance?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.960
You still don't understand?

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:01.280
You're just like me.

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:04.270
Try as you might to play the good 
guy, you can't erase the past...

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:09.850
No, if you win the battles, 
you can erase it from your mind.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.110
I see!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.690
So that's your wish this time!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.030
Coin bet!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.740
Peeping.

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.380
Level 4.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.400
Nice!

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:35.860
This skill lets you see into 
another's heart, right?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.760
Go right ahead!

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:42.050
That was a bad idea...

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:43.700
Piruluk!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.850
There's nothing but darkness and emptiness.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.430
Pure black darkness...

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.940
Hey, that's rude!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:58.200
Even I'm feeling hurt.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.950
Coin bet.

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:03.530
Joker.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.690
Transform Hataru into Solar Flare.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:08.530
No...

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.000
Attack!

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.540
You're afraid of me.

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.920
It's like looking at your old self.

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:19.790
But you can't stop thinking about me.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:20.930
You want to look at me

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.390
and tell yourself that 
you're somehow different!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.880
Isn't that right?

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:32.020
Piruluk!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.140
It's fine.

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.770
Nothing wrong with that.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.820
I want to pay the humans back 
for creating me, after all!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.750
I wanted to fight you more.

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.080
Too bad.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:04.760
Well, if you want to do it with 
me again, just come see me.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:10.350
You seemed to be having fun.

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:13.160
Yeah, I guess.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:16.300
Then your cute girl hasn't changed?

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:17.740
No.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:20.070
The only thing that really 
interests me is those kids.

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:25.130
Now, which will it be that fights me?

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:30.870
Where are they?

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.290
Morikawa?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:41.550
Turn end.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:44.170
My turn...

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.070
This is your chance, Rio-chan!

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:46.970
Yeah.

00:20:47.210 --> 00:20:48.870
Shou-chan, at this rate...

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.780
I'm sorry, Donor.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.520
What should I have done?

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.940
It really frustrates me.

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:01.090
I don't want it to end here.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.530
Mommy, victory strike!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.620
<i>I wanted to protect her.</i>

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.070
<i>To protect her...</i>

00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:19.020
I did it! I did it!

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:20.460
Thanks, mister!

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:23.840
Hey, next time you have a battle,

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.420
you should play stronger cards first.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.980
That's what I always do.

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.700
Chinatsu-oneechan!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:34.380
I won!

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:36.740
I think he messed up.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.060
Onee-chan?

00:21:42.760 --> 00:21:44.280
Shou-chan...

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.260
I fought to be rid of them.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:30.680
I fight to protect them.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.160
For now, I want to protect you.

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.160
I'm with you.

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:35.090
What do you know?!

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:36.340
I'll take them back!

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:40.980
Next time: The Two / Suzuko and Chinatsu.

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:40.980
The Two / Suzuko and Chinatsu
